# Optional: your own premium RPC endpoints (with keys) for the fastmint pool.
# The repo's shipped .env (the author's QuikNode endpoint) is DELIBERATELY NOT
# included here. Fill these in only with endpoints you control, keep this file
# mode 600, and never commit or share it. If left empty, the public RPC pool
# in lib.js is used.
# FASTMINT_RPCS_EXTRA=https://your-endpoint.example
# FASTMINT_WS_EXTRA=wss://your-endpoint.example
